    "verdict": "Every published generation now has a collision-resistant identity in the repository, derived from the bytes on the live plane, alongside the CRC-32-based name the platform assigns."
  },
  "owner_task": "fs2-live-scientific-evidence-fable-gate-r20260903",
  "question": "the generation name binds each file only by length and CRC-32; what is the cryptographic identity of those bytes?",
  "reviewer": "claude-fable-5-1-xhigh, independent of the publishing worker",
